{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66fe92e5594db8320a949435b1456b9164024bd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-\\frac{4}{x}+\\frac{4}{x^2}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"122\" height=\"37\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/c/68ce078245d523b9ca0fea0dd53267f107903bc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"37\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/1/131326a646ca8f61fa4f659f8b513caa67fa1c4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }-1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }-1\\text{ or }2\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }-1\\text{ or }-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"511\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By guessing and checking, 2 works. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/0122b628ddec078f18f1947b8c0f9034e71d27a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{x} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)  }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"94\" height=\"37\" />\n~awin\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying each side by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/6/2a6b5cc4f79ca7e37cb1e67052c2bf210ef26ac8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-4x+4 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />. Factoring, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/b/c1b71ab6e84201530866878f52c941ca17bcf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-2)(x-2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/0122b628ddec078f18f1947b8c0f9034e71d27a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{x} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)  }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"94\" height=\"37\" />\n~awin\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Directly factoring, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df8ac76e3baa27d841a8892066573328dbaa7e68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-\\frac{2}{x})^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"100\" height=\"37\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/c/68ce078245d523b9ca0fea0dd53267f107903bc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"37\" /> must equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e101201addd96f637069ef5899fa2b44223efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)  }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_0&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 0 (page does not exist)\">Problem 0</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_P